## Q1. Multiplication Table

```javascript
let num = Number(prompt("Enter a number:"));
let i = 1;

while (i <= 10) {
    console.log(num + " x " + i + " = " + (num * i));
    i++;
}
```

**Input:** `7`

**Output:**

```text
7 x 1 = 7
7 x 2 = 14
7 x 3 = 21
...
7 x 10 = 70
```

