## Q3. Prime Number

```javascript
let num = Number(prompt("Enter an integer:"));

let i = 2;
let isPrime = true;

if (num <= 1) {
    isPrime = false;
}

while (i < num) {
    if (num % i === 0) {
        isPrime = false;
        break;
    }
    i++;
}

if (isPrime) {
    console.log(num + " is prime number.");
} else {
    console.log(num + " is not prime number.");
}
```

**Input:** `5`

**Output:**

```text
5 is prime number.
```

