## Q6. Perfect Number

```javascript
let num = Number(prompt("Enter a number:"));

let i = 1;
let sum = 0;

while (i < num) {

    if (num % i === 0) {
        sum = sum + i;
    }

    i++;
}

if (sum === num) {
    console.log(num + " is a perfect number.");
} else {
    console.log(num + " is not a perfect number.");
}
```

**Input:**

